
=== Cuarto1 (ColdRoom_1) — 2 evaporador(es) — mapeo: CRUZADO ===
  dash evap1  ->  EvaporatorUnit_2
  dash evap2  ->  EvaporatorUnit_1
  defrost: room-level DefrostController=PRESENTE | per-evap=2/2 ['EvaporatorUnit_1', 'EvaporatorUnit_2']
 Diferencias/faltantes:
  MISSING fac  evap1TerminateOnResistanceTemp
  MISSING fac  evap1ResistanceTempThreshold
  DIFF  evap2 evap2Setpoint=4.0  !=  rt evapSetpoint=4.5
  DIFF  evap2 evap2DifferentialUp=1.5  !=  rt evapDifferentialUp=0.0
  DIFF  evap2 evap2FreezeActive=false  !=  rt freezeActive=true
  MISSING fac  evap2FreezeDiffRestart
  DIFF  evap2 evap2DefrostInterval=PT6H0S  !=  rt DefrostController/interval=PT20M0S
  DIFF  evap2 evap2DefrostDuration=PT20M0S  !=  rt DefrostController/duration=PT30M0S
  DIFF  evap2 evap2TerminateOnResistanceTemp=false  !=  rt DefrostController/terminateOnResistanceTemp=true
  MISSING fac  evap2ResistanceTempThreshold

